  "description": "Hosts a zipped web app (Blazor, React, anything static) in a .NET MAUI WebView, served from the Shiny.AppDeviceBridge server: kept up to date through a pluggable update provider — a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge.AspNetCore release server with every download verified against a signature, GitHub releases, or one of your own, a bundled baseline for offline first launch, a dev server proxy for hot reload, and a launch session that keeps the bridges to the app's own page.",
